h\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/f143af3f2f016628db716aecf573fab4.avif?t=1781044185\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>D.R.I.F.T. is:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow and deliberate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System-driven</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contract-based</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation-focused</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/b86053e71017190326d1e37b6de71b2e.avif?t=1781044185\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>D.R.I.F.T. is NOT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative-driven experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A power fantasy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036980/extras/42d1fc20945959c6209f39dddcb2ab6c.avif?t=1781044185\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>&quot;The galaxy doesn’t care if you succeed&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
